    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14px;&quot;&gt;The proposed replacement soffits, fascias and rainwater goods, by virtue of their design and materiality, would represent an unsympathetic intervention to the locally listed host building. This is considered harmful to the character and appearance of the dwelling, terrace row and wider conservation area. The proposal therefore fails to comply with the design and heritage objectives of Policies 53, 72, 74 and 75 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
